# subterranean - 118bpm, dorian chord stabs, deep and slow
bpm 118
swing 14
humanize kick 5
humanize hat 5
humanize oh 5
humanize clap 5
humanize snare 5
humanize perc 5
humanize bass 5
humanize stab 5
kick x...x...x...x...
hat ..x...x...x...x.
filter hat hp 7000
gain hat 0.5
stab a1 . . g1 f#1 . . d1! . . . . f#1 g1~ . a2
filter stab lp 900 res 0.3
sidechain stab 0.5
